!:
::  p3 regression: under !:, a doccord between two =/ binders (++smol: two
::  aces and en-links of any kind; ++larg: four aces) anchors the next =/'s
::  %dbug spot at the doc line; any other comment is skipped by the gap.
|%
++  main
  |=  a=@
  =/  b  1
  ::  $main: a plan link
  =/  c  2
  ::  .c: a frag link
  =/  d  3
  ::  |chap
  =/  e  4
  ::  %1: a cone link
  =/  f  5
  ::  +a +b: two links
  =/  g  6
  ::     five aces
  =/  h  7
  ::   three aces
  =/  i  8
  ::  plain prose
  =/  j  9
  ::    four aces
  =/  k  10
  [b c d e f g h i j k]
--
